Cross-Couplings of Unactivated Alkyl Chlorides
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Ackermann, Lutz; Kapdi, Anant R.; Schulzke, Carola
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
